  "text": "Barrick appoints mining contractor for the Lumwana Super Pit Project\n\nBarrick Mining Corporation has appointed Kanyika Mining Services Limited as the mining contractor for the Lumwana Super Pit Project in North-Western Province.\n\nThe five year contract is worth US$410 million. The contractor will operate a fleet of 45 haul trucks and will start to mobilise in November 2026. Barrick said that the expansion will raise copper output to about 240,000 tonnes a year.",
